# ── Allow-list: only the port's own files are in this repository. ──
# Game data (disc image, extracted files, installs, saves) and the
# recompiled game code never are: players supply their own disc.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/.github/
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/recomplauncher.json
!/docs/
!/port/
!/blender_plugin/

# Inside port/: generated game code, builds, installers, test runs, captures
/port/generated/
/port/out/
/port/runs/
/port/installer/
/port/screenshots/
/port/res/*
!/port/res/xmd.rc
!/port/res/README.md
/port/tools/__pycache__/

# Never, wherever they are: game files and built programs
*.xex
*.iso
*.xiso
*.zzz
*.gz
*.bnk
*.xma
*.usm
*.gfx
*.swf
*.xsc
*.exe
*.dll
*.pdb
*.bin
*.ico
*.log
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
